ll change each  month additionally rockstar announced  that there will be special gta shark  cards available to buy from the  playstation and microsoft stores that  have extra allotment of cash beyond  normal what's more gta plus members will  get exclusive rewards from places like  legendary motorsport maze bank  foreclosures dock teas and other stores  in gta online rockstar also confirmed  that gta online's regular online events  will continue as normal for everyone  regardless of their membership status  now let's go back to playstation news  for a sec because new production images  and even a video from hbo's the last of  us adaptation have been published by  eagle eye fans eurogamer was the first  to notice and scoop up these closer  looks at the show offering the best  looks yet at protagonist joel and ellie  although confirmation that the show  won't be released until sometime 2023  these leaked clips have given fans their  first look at supporting character sam  and henry in the games the characters  are sibling survivors who cross paths  with joel and ellie however their  meeting has a profound effect on ellie  throughout both games are you looking  forward to the last of our show have you  watched the halo show yet let me know in  the comments below
 

